{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 24, :comments ["<b>You have begun.</b> One of the sages said: \"You have begun to show Your greatness\" — in heaven and on earth, through the deeds by which the world is governed." "<b>And Your strong hand.</b> Through the signs performed through him, until it became known in the world that there is no El but Him alone. The reasoning is compelling: <b>in heaven</b> — where the angels and the host are; <b>and on earth</b> — where the living creatures and human beings are." "<b>Like Your deeds.</b> For they are all in wisdom." "<b>And Your might.</b> In power. And the reason for this passage is to endear the Land of Israel, and if the land is beloved, they will keep the commandments of HaShem so as not to be exiled from it."], :book :deuteronomy, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 3, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:22:10.072746282Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}